After installing this .pkg, add the following export:

export DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH="@CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib:${DYLD_LIBRARY_PATH}"

If user facing scripts (gufi_find, gufi_ls, etc.) are required,

export PYTHONPATH="@CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib:${PYTHONPATH}"

or move @CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib/gufi_common.py and @CPACK_PACKAGING_INSTALL_PREFIX@/lib/gufi_config.py to another directory and add that directory to PYTHONPATH
